  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">County Adm Boards 99/2000</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">V&#xE4;nl&#xE4;nssamarbete 99/2000</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">L&#xE4;nsstyrelsesamverkan med Estland, Lettland och Litauen. Projektm&#xE5;len &#xE4;r assistera de baltiska staterna genom kunskaps&#xF6;verf&#xF6;ring och erfarenhetsutbyte. Det &#xF6;vergripanmde projektm&#xE5;let &#xE4;r att &#xF6;ka kompetens och kapacitet inom lokal och regional administartion.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish County Administration Board in cooperation with the County Administration Boards in Estonia, Lithuania and in Latvia. The aim of the cooperation is transfer of knowledge and exchange of experience. The overall aim is to increase the competence and capability within the local and regional administration.</narrative>
  </description>
